{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065002/block/singleImage/3274132/df/01M7ZDQPS2SSW2754GSQ5VB0G1.png?updatedAt=1795277229\"/><figcaption>荃灣柴灣角街83至93號榮興工業大廈（Google Map/資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>荃灣有人猝死。警方表示，周六（21日）晚上7時許，一名20歲李姓青年在柴灣角街83至93號榮興工業大廈一個在其租用的單位暈倒，附近鄰居報案。 救護員接報到場，證實李男當場死亡，事主死因有待驗屍後確定，案件列作屍體發現。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T17:24:14.797338+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T19:37:32.760284+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T17:17:34.268244+00:00","content_hash":"9039c6c1dd1610f2f22908c4fbb67fccc08335b168ce663605b800bdd3239ee8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T17:24:14.797338+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}